; GraphEdit showing its zoom label, the one `show_*` flag that defaults off (graph_edit.h:192).
; The label is a 48*scale-wide Label at the head of the toolbar row, showing `round(zoom * 100)%`
; (graph_edit.cpp:2620-2624). It widens the panel by a column no sibling fixture has, and is the
; only place the zoom value reaches a still frame.

; Every fixture in this family shares one GraphEdit rect and one GraphNode, and only
; unit-graph-edit-scroll-offset-clamped.tscn authors `scroll_offset`: `set_scroll_offset` clamps
; against bounds no child has widened while properties apply (graph_edit.cpp:407), so an authored
; offset moves the grid, the nodes and the minimap camera together and masks the one variable.

[gd_scene load_steps=1 format=3 uid="uid://unitgraphedzoomlbl"]

